# This repository is nested inside the parent project, and git does not read a
# parent's .gitignore across a repository boundary — so the rules that already
# exist one level up have to be restated here to have any effect. That gap is
# how 15MB of archive, dSYMs and a signed .ipa came to be tracked in the first
# place.
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
xcuserdata/
.DS_Store

# Xcode project is generated from project.yml by `xcodegen generate`.
# Left tracked for now: it is what `open Locked.xcodeproj` needs on a fresh
# clone before xcodegen has run.
